 ning will begin with an intimate artist talk by ariana Farquharson\, offer
 ing a behind-the-scenes look at the personal narratives and techniques tha
 t shaped the exhibition\, You Are Here: Geolocating the Self through the F
 amiliar in the Midst of the Unfamiliar.
